</div></li></ul></div></div><div class="PvH0kLdZ"></div></nav></div></div></div></header><!-- --></div></div><div data-metric-area="topo-noticia"><!-- --><div class="solar-header-columnist" data-v-623b1e45=""><div class="solar-header-columnist-container mid-container" data-v-623b1e45=""><div class="solar-header-columnist-info" data-v-623b1e45=""><div class="solar-header-columnist-image" data-v-623b1e45=""><a class="no-link link" data-v-623b1e45="" href="https://www.uol.com.br/ecoa/colunas/mariana-sgarioni/"><img alt="Mariana Sgarioni" data-v-623b1e45="" height="90" src="https://conteudo.imguol.com.br/2f/2024/05/28/mariana-sgarioni-autor-1716908021617_260x180.png" width="130"/></a></div><div class="solar-header-columnist-content" data-v-623b1e45=""><h2 class="heading-3" data-v-623b1e45=""><a class="no-link link" data-v-623b1e45="" href="https://www.uol.com.br/ecoa/colunas/mariana-sgarioni/">Mariana Sgarioni</a></h2><button class="solar-button is-medium tm-primary list show-skeleton regular-text-2" data-v-623b1e45="" data-v-a07e0476="" disabled="disabled" is-bold="true" type="button"><span class="content-wrapper" data-v-a07e0476=""><span class="label-wrapper" data-v-a07e0476=""><!-- -->Sobre a autora<span class="solar-icon" data-name="arrow-drop-right-line" data-v-3112d719="" data-v-a07e0476="" style="--icon-size:24px;"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><use xlink:href="#icons-arrow-drop-right-line"></use></svg></span></span><!-- --></span><!-- --></button></div></div><div class="solar-header-columnist-socialmedia-content" data-v-623b1e45=""><div class="solar-header-columnist-socialmedia solar-social-media vertical" data-v-623b1e45="" data-v-6619f140=""><div class="label" data-v-6619f140=""><span class="regular-subtext" data-v-6619f140=""> Siga nas redes </span></div><div class="list main" data-v-6619f140=""><div class="item" data-v-6619f140=""><a aria-label="Acesse nosso linkedin" class="icon" data-v-6619f140="" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mariana-sgarioni/" style="--so