<script name="schema:software-application" type="application/ld+json">
        {"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"iCatcher! Podcast Player","description":"Download, listen, watch and enjoy your favorite podcasts.\n\nFEATURES\nâ¢ Subscribe to your favorite podcasts in the app and manage them in the app\nâ¢ Download episodes over WiFi or Cellular (on devices that have cellular).\nâ¢ Support for Password Protected feeds\nâ¢ Background Refresh\nâ¢ Download in the background\nâ¢ Sync subscriptions, episode playback positions and playlists between your devices with iCloud\nâ¢ Universal App (iPhone/iPad)\nâ¢ Search in all views to find that podcast or episode you are looking for\nâ¢ Custom playlists with filtering options by podcast, episodes and more.\nâ¢ Support for continuous playback (toggle it on now playing screen just below time elapsed).\nâ¢ All device orientations supported with configurable option in the settings\nâ¢ You can unsubscribe to podcasts and still have them on your device. Use that for those less than stellar podcasts!\n\nPLAYBACK\nâ¢ Variable playback speed\nâ¢ Playback speed remembered per podcast\nâ¢ Support for podcasts with chapters and chapter images (MP3 and M4A)\nâ¢ Use your headset controls including Bluetooth car controls (when paired) to play/pause, jump forward or back 30 seconds\nâ¢ Sleep timer\nâ¢ Beautifully rendered show notes\nâ¢ Onscreen controls for skipping ahead and skipping back\nâ¢ Gesture Support on the now playing screen (when the podcast logo is showing) to aid in hands free use\n    â¢ Double-tap to play/pause\n    â¢ Swipe up to toggle playback speed\n    â¢ Swipe left/right to rewind/fast-forward \n    â¢ Home of the L gesture for the 2 minute Leo jump.\nâ¢ See Settings and Gestures for more and for customizing rewind/fast-forward gestures\nâ¢ Support for AirPlay, watch or listen to those podcasts on your big screen\nâ¢ Support for external display of videos for devices that support an external display (get the Apple HDMI adapter)\nâ¢ Watch or listen to your favorite podcasts with a familiar layout\n\nFIND NEW PODCASTS QUICK\nâ¢ Find your podcasts by title, keyword or by author\nâ¢ Browse the top podcasts by category\nâ¢ Manually add podcasts with a URL\n    â¢ Support for Password Protected feeds \nâ¢ Option to download a single episode\nâ¢ Browse the web in the app to find podcasts to add. Browser will prompt if you tap a link that is podcast feed.\nâ¢ Import Podcast subscriptions for episodes that are already in your device from iTunes\nâ¢ Import your OPML file from iTunes or other iOS podcast app\nâ¢ Import media by using iTunes File Sharing feature\nâ¢ Add your existing audiobooks (non-password protected ones) using iTunes File Sharing feature\nâ¢ Add previously downloaded podcasts from your computer using iTunes file sharing feature (see settings and import media for details).\n\nMORE \nâ¢ Completely customizable to meet your podcasts needs.\nâ¢ Swipe across a podcast or episode to access additional options\nâ¢ Podcast settings allow you to set the days the podcast typically comes out or the number of days between.\nâ¢ Specify the number of episodes to download when new ones are available\nâ¢ Share the podcast information via email with your friends\n\nCONTACT\nEmail: tap Help tab and tap Email Support\nTwitter/X: @Joeisanerd\n\nPLEASE NOTE: The app does NOT sync with iTunes. Like other podcast apps it is standalone app meant to subscribe and download on the device.\n\n* If a feed doesn't work, then let me know so I can take a look at it\n\nRequires iOS 17.4 or higher.","screenshot":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/e6/5b/54/e65b54c9-5c4e-cb6c-fd51-ba15bd54c57b/453210f4-827f-49a8-a3d3-963ad9687851_Simulator_Screenshot_-_iPad_Pro__U002812.9-inch_U0029__U00286th_generation_U0029_-_2023-10-21_at_08.31.51.png/643x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/0a/23/f5/0a23f539-93d5-2ab8-210d-3d2177b55633/bc6fab02-f1c1-411e-8a80-5b58c7afc875_Simulator_Screenshot_-_iPad_Pro__U002812.9-inch_U0029__U00286th_generation_U0029_-_2023-10-21_at_08.32.14.png/643x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/22/24/1b/22241bf8-e21c-e492-d934-22919d4c8942/1773fd08-31e2-4dfc-af0d-37254330b3fb_Simulator_Screenshot_-_iPad_Pro__U002812.9-inch_U0029__U00286th_generation_U0029_-_2023-10-21_at_08.28.51.png/643x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/78/c2/88/78c28867-21d2-0e43-779c-9eeb52ea8b7b/8670827e-a512-487b-b9b0-c9a2acffb7ca_Screenshot1.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/6e/47/18/6e4718bd-838b-9e9d-c452-e6f8e88cf50b/1fccab24-5259-44ab-8e94-b7a4604d40bd_Screenshot2.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/cf/ee/5f/cfee5ff6-b1a1-3e25-e1b3-bc56eabad08f/e2a75e22-d0c9-4947-b8ac-23bdbc078062_Screenshot3.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/35/3a/f9/353af948-384b-d37e-c6fb-a90fbe54fb69/de04e1d6-15b6-47e2-8c3b-cc4964e0a384_Screenshot4.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/f7/33/f2/f733f250-20dc-c1fe-7caf-aead514fa45e/990692d7-1db2-4250-bd20-9a3994b310ca_Screenshot5.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/d2/19/d2/d219d23f-7265-be06-c3cc-20d6d36360de/0cbef92c-fae2-43e7-928e-c7d54a0e69fc_incoming-776FBCC0-4D85-42E2-8F7F-E84BD0849915.PNG/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/2e/b3/fa/2eb3fad3-70a9-ea97-1e93-6c24fc96830a/09044cb3-83c4-4191-90d4-b499aeec5d71_incoming-38D70C48-791B-4F5F-8DB8-7188C2D84DE3.PNG/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/4a/be/e8/4abee823-5a7a-51ec-d117-56208a17a3e4/a0f13a73-355c-4ed4-963d-ef772f7d97e6_incoming-546096C4-FE95-471E-A295-3CB115A0D060.PNG/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/d4/15/9d/d4159dbb-1205-ed54-0697-d836d28a5940/95664b59-1032-423b-b6c4-556612f3dec6_incoming-373ED928-BF8B-4832-A161-ECB0291839B8.PNG/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/b6/ab/51/b6ab5104-41bd-5480-f9be-01d3e64b268b/2f0b9e75-cc8c-4c49-848c-ee25bf067897_incoming-D674676D-66A4-40EF-883D-19AD1C374A48.PNG/300x0w.jpg"],"image":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/6a/7a/95/6a7a955a-da80-e549-7d04-a9c3eef7013f/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-1-0-85-220.png/1200x630wa.png","applicationCategory":"NotÃ­cias","datePublished":"15 de mar. de 2011","operatingSystem":"Requer iOSÂ 17.4 e watchOSÂ 8.7 ou posterior. CompatÃ­vel com iPhone, iPad e iPodÂ touch.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Joeisanerd.com","url":"https://apps.apple.com/br/developer/joeisanerd-com/id284973030"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":4.9,"reviewCount":7},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":24.9,"priceCurrency":"BRL"}}
