<section class="l-content-width section section--bordered">
<div class="section__description">
<h2 class="section__headline visuallyhidden">DescriÃ§Ã£o</h2>
<div class="l-row">
<div class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive l-column small-12 medium-9 large-8" dir="">
<p data-test-bidi="" dir="false">Download, listen, watch and enjoy your favorite podcasts.<br/><br/>FEATURES<br/>â¢ Subscribe to your favorite podcasts in the app and manage them in the app<br/>â¢ Download episodes over WiFi or Cellular (on devices that have cellular).<br/>â¢ Support for Password Protected feeds<br/>â¢ Background Refresh<br/>â¢ Download in the background<br/>â¢ Sync subscriptions, episode playback positions and playlists between your devices with iCloud<br/>â¢ Universal App (iPhone/iPad)<br/>â¢ Search in all views to find that podcast or episode you are looking for<br/>â¢ Custom playlists with filtering options by podcast, episodes and more.<br/>â¢ Support for continuous playback (toggle it on now playing screen just below time elapsed).<br/>â¢ All device orientations supported with configurable option in the settings<br/>â¢ You can unsubscribe to podcasts and still have them on your device. Use that for those less than stellar podcasts!<br/><br/>PLAYBACK<br/>â¢ Variable playback speed<br/>â¢ Playback speed remembered per podcast<br/>â¢ Support for podcasts with chapters and chapter images (MP3 and M4A)<br/>â¢ Use your headset controls including Bluetooth car controls (when paired) to play/pause, jump forward or back 30 seconds<br/>â¢ Sleep timer<br/>â¢ Beautifully rendered show notes<br/>â¢ Onscreen controls for skipping ahead and skipping back<br/>â¢ Gesture Support on the now playing screen (when the podcast logo is showing) to aid in hands free use<br/>    â¢ Double-tap to play/pause<br/>    â¢ Swipe up to toggle playback speed<br/>    â¢ Swipe left/right to rewind/fast-forward <br/>    â¢ Home of the L gesture for the 2 minute Leo jump.<br/>â¢ See Settings and Gestures for more and for customizing rewind/fast-forward gestures<br/>â¢ Support for AirPlay, watch or listen to those podcasts on your big screen<br/>â¢ Support for external display of videos for devices that support an external display (get the Apple HDMI adapter)<br/>â¢ Watch or listen to your favorite podcasts with a familiar layout<br/><br/>FIND NEW PODCASTS QUICK<br/>â¢ Find your podcasts by title, keyword or by author<br/>â¢ Browse the top podcasts by category<br/>â¢ Manually add podcasts with a URL<br/>    â¢ Support for Password Protected feeds <br/>â¢ Option to download a single episode<br/>â¢ Browse the web in the app to find podcasts to add. Browser will prompt if you tap a link that is podcast feed.<br/>â¢ Import Podcast subscriptions for episodes that are already in your device from iTunes<br/>â¢ Import your OPML file from iTunes or other iOS podcast app<br/>â¢ Import media by using iTunes File Sharing feature<br/>â¢ Add your existing audiobooks (non-password protected ones) using iTunes File Sharing feature<br/>â¢ Add previously downloaded podcasts from your computer using iTunes file sharing feature (see settings and import media for details).<br/><br/>MORE <br/>â¢ Completely customizable to meet your podcasts needs.<br/>â¢ Swipe across a podcast or episode to access additional options<br/>â¢ Podcast settings allow you to set the days the podcast typically comes out or the number of days between.<br/>â¢ Specify the number of episodes to download when new ones are available<br/>â¢ Share the podcast information via email with your friends<br/><br/>CONTACT<br/>Email: tap Help tab and tap Email Support<br/>Twitter/X: @Joeisanerd<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: The app does NOT sync with iTunes. Like other podcast apps it is standalone app meant to subscribe and download on the device.<br/><br/>* If a feed doesn't work, then let me know so I can take a look at it<br/><br/>Requires iOS 17.4 or higher.</p>
