<blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive we-customer-review__body" dir="">
<p data-test-bidi="" dir="false">Lovely app, but thereâs a few things still missing:<br/>- support for EPISODES (not the show) notes and chapters;<br/>- stability; there are a few crashes on my iPhone 11 (iOS 13.5);<br/>- more speed options (1.2x and 1.7x);<br/>- possibly a Mac catalyst app?</p>
