<blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive we-customer-review__body" dir="">
<p data-test-bidi="" dir="false">Hi!<br/>I will add more speed options for you in the upcoming 7.4 release. You can see podcast notes by clicking the dots or the podcast image. <br/>I will look in to chapters and stability issue.<br/><br/>Thanks for your feedback, have a nice day. <br/><br/>/Miguel</p>
