e\":\"Miguel Krantz\",\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPodÂ touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iOSÂ 15.0 ou posterior.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iOSÂ 15.0 ou posterior.\"},\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iPadOSÂ 15.0 ou posterior.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"12.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Trusted by 10+ thousands of people worldwide. Toddy is a delightfully simple yet powerful task planner and to-do list app. \\nFinally, organize your work and life. \\n\\nUse Toddy to plan or track anything\\nâ¢ Daily reminders\\nâ¢ Style change background color font size etc\\nâ¢ Repeatable tasks\\nâ¢ Habit tracker\\nâ¢ Daily planner\\nâ¢ Weekly planner\\nâ¢ Holiday planner\\nâ¢ Grocery list\\nâ¢ Study planner\\nâ¢ Shopping list\\nâ¢ To-do list\\nâ¢  Stop timer (Pomadoro) \\nâ¢ Integrated into Apples Calendar (Select calendar to use)\\nâ¢ Siri support\\nâ¢ And more\\n\\nQuickly enter your ideas and set reminders (if you want).\\nClear widget shows the number of tasks.\\n\\nSuper simple and stripped-down app that only syncs with Apple's built-in calendar.\\nNo registration or other hassle.\\n\\nTip:\\nAdd a widget to quickly add new thoughts and ideas.\\n\\nWith Toddy you can do the following:\\n* Paste text and create new tasks\\n* Change Color theme\\n* Change background and color, font style\\n* Open URL from task list\\n* Create task with reminder\\n* Create repetitive task with checkboxes 2-10 pcs\\n* Create shopping list with checkboxes\\n* Change the colors of the data\\n* Add and configure widget that displays the data\\n* Add widget to quickly create a new task\\n* Syncs tasks with Apple's built-in calendar\\n* Tap a task to display menu, quickly set reminder or delete task\\n* Swipe to delete task\\n* Personalize how you want your information to look\\nName your list\\n* Mark a task as hidden, then the task does not count. It can be useful for small things that you want to save eg pin code or a link\\n* Support for Siri shortcuts\\n\\nTerms of Use:\\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\\n\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"websiteUrl\":\"http://toddy.se\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bugfixes and stability improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-03T15:17:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"# Now you can set a custom date reminder from the context meny in the tak list\\n# Try out the new feature to set a specific color theme\\n\\n+ Bug fixes and performance improvements\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-20T23:42:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"   # Change Task Color from left swipe in overview\\n    # New language support Chinese simplified\\n    Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-11T19:28:07Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Now you can copy the text from the list, tap on a task in the overview view, select copy text\\n- Create a new task by pasting text from another app\\n+ Bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-06T21:17:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\\n\\nIf you are missing something or have found a bug, do not hesitate to contact me\\npodsplayer@gmail.com\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-10-15T02:32:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-13T22:37:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\\n\\nWe are constantly making changes and improvements to Toddy. Make sure you enable updates so you do not miss anything.\\n\\nIf you have comments, questions or ideas, please contact us at podsplayer@gmail.com. Thank you for using Toddy!\\n\\n/ Toddy- Team\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-01T23:22:23Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"# When yo change text style it applies to all created and new tasks\\n# Improved support for syncing the list between multiple devices using iCloud\\n# After some complains, the done button is now a cross icon again.\\n# UI improvements\\n\\nIf you are missing something or have found a bug, do not hesitate to contact me\\npodsplayer@gmail.com\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-30T15:54:56Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We are constantly making changes and improvements to Toddy. Make sure you enable updates so you do not miss anything.\\n\\nIf you are missing something or have found a bug, do not hesitate to contact us\\npodsplayer@gmail.com\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-23T06:10:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"# Sort list actions \\n# design actions, small, regular\\n# Force touche Task in list, change reminder time +/-\\nand bugfixes\\n\\nIf you are missing something or have found a bug, do not hesitate to contact me\\npodsplayer@gmail.com\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-13T22:35:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New Features\\n# Sort the list by pressing and dragging the arrows to the right of any task.\\n# Show and hide all extra actions in Task List\\n\\nMissing any feature? or have improvements suggestions please mail \\npodsplayer@gmail.com \\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-02-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-02-01T22:45:47Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this release:\\nYou can now configure your lists to delete the items when they are done, \\nThanks Leon for the suggested feature.\\n\\n+ Bug fixes  and UI Improvements\\nMissing any feature? or have improvements suggestions please mail \\npodsplayer@gmail.com or @Pods \\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-24T11:44:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bugfix for marking checkboxes in task list overview not working all the time.\\n\\nMissing any feature? or have improvements suggestions please mail \\npodsplayer@gmail.com \",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-19\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-19T11:52:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"# You can now share your shopping lists as an image with your friends\\n# Remind or Challenge Yourself,  Write personal messages to yourself that are sent as notices whenever you want\\n\\n+ Bug fixes  and UI Improvements\\n\\nMissing any feature? or have improvements suggestions please mail \\npodsplayer@gmail.com \",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-16T23:12:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Bug fixes  and UI Improvements\\n\\nMissing any feature? or have improvements suggestions please mail \\npodsplayer@gmail.com \",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-02T13:02:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixed a crash that occured when marking a task as done when it is hidden\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-12-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-12-26T15:09:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"When tapping the cross on any task it will be marked as done a common delete view is used to delete them later.Â \\nStill if you swipe to left its possible to delete the task directly\\n\\nIf you are missing something or have found a bug, do not hesitate to contact me\\npodsplayer@gmail.com\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-12-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-12-22T14:23:42Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Thanks for using Toddy\\n\\nNew in this Version:\\n- Added a new timer so you can track your repeat tasks or just focus a little bit more\\n- Configure the timer from settings page\\n- Set reminders 20min and tomorrow from Task context menu\\n- Added 3d touche shortcuts for adding new task or displaying hidden tasks.\u2028Access the new actions by force touch the app icon\\n- Displaying time of first reminder in overview list\\n- Widget support for iPad\\n\\nIf you are missing something or have found a bug, do not hesitate to contact me\\npodsplayer@gmail.com\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-09-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-09-18T09:10:41Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"# Added support for iPad \\n# Added iCloud support for syncing of tasks on multiple devices \\nIf you have multiple devices connected to the same Apple iCloud account you\\ncan now share tasks between the devices if you want.\\n\\nIf you are missing something or have found a bug, do not hesitate to contact me\\npodsplayer@gmail.com\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-09-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-09-05T13:54:40Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Now you can customize the look of the Toddy app.\\nSelect the image or color on the Home screen and the Widget.\\n\\nIf you are missing something or have found a bug, do not hesitate to contact me\\npodsplayer@gmail.com\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-08-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-08-24T11:54:44Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bugfix for UI not updated correctly when repeat reminder is used\\n\\nMissing any feature? or have improvements suggestions please mail \\npodsplayer@gmail.com \\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-08-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-08-15T17:20:18Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New Features:\\n- Hide a task by swiping to the right or select hide from context menu. Access all hidden tasks\\n- Name your task list\\n\\nBugfixes:\\n# Wrong calendar was pre-selected at installation time\\n# Widget UI update\\n\\nMissing any feature? or have improvements suggestions please mail \\npodsplayer@gmail.com \",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-08-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-08-01T17:05:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and enhancements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-03T18:14:43Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and enhancements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-05-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-05-05T15:50:20Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Now you can choose which calendar to use for reminders.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-04-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-04-21T19:47:38Z\"}],\"isXROSCompatible\":false,\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1544668942\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=phoenix\u0026appExtVrsId=853612263\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"R$Â 0,00\",\"price\":0,\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"currencyCode\":\"BRL\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":29596672}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1544668942\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=phoenix\u0026appExtVrsId=853612263\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"R$Â 0,00\",\"price\":0,\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"currencyCode\":\"BRL\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":29596672}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2021-02-11\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"app.Toddy\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple122/v4/75/f4/22/75f42237-2e22-3138-97cb-704723e1b4f5/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000002\",\"textColor1\":\"f8ffff\",\"textColor2\":\"c1c7c8\",\"textColor3\":\"c6cbcc\",\"textColor4\":\"9a9fa