",\"identifier\":\"OTHER\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsBrazil\":{\"name\":\"Brazil L\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":6},\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"+4\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":1}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipad\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/br/app/restore-ai-photo-enhancer/id6448942710\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":0,\"ratingCount\":0,\"ratingCountList\":[0,0,0,0,0],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"0 estrela\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Foto e vÃ­deo\",\"name\":\"Restore: AI Photo Enhancer\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"27GROUP\",\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":true,\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iPadOSÂ 16.6 ou posterior.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iOSÂ 16.6 ou posterior.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o macOSÂ 13.5 ou posterior e um Mac com o chip M1 da Apple ou posterior.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o visionOSÂ 1.0 ou posterior.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"13.5\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Introducing \\\"Restore: AI Photo Enhancer\\\" â the ultimate app to breathe new life into your old photos! Restore is a powerful tool that combines advanced artificial intelligence technology with cutting-edge image processing algorithms to transform your cherished memories like never before.\\n\\nWith Restore, you can effortlessly bring back the vibrant colors of faded and black-and-white photos. Say goodbye to the monotone past and rediscover the beauty of yesteryears with just a few taps. Simply upload your old photos, and let Restore's AI algorithms analyze and enhance each image, intelligently restoring the original colors and details.\\n\\nNot only does Restore revive the color of your photos, but it also specializes in restoring damaged and deteriorated images. Whether your photos have scratches, stains, or other imperfections, this app employs sophisticated restoration techniques to seamlessly repair them, ensuring that your precious moments are preserved flawlessly.\\n\\nEver wanted to remove distracting bars or unwanted objects from your photos? With Restore, you can effortlessly eliminate those elements that mar the visual appeal of your images. The app intelligently identifies and removes unwanted elements, leaving behind a clean and professional-looking photo.\\n\\nMoreover, Restore goes beyond restoration and offers advanced tools to enhance the overall quality of your images. From adjusting brightness and contrast to refining sharpness and clarity, this app provides an array of editing options to perfect your photos and make them truly stand out.\\n\\nKey Features:\\n\\n- Colorize old black-and-white and faded photos with AI technology\\n- Restore and repair damaged or deteriorated images\\n- Remove unwanted bars, objects, or distractions from your photos\\n- Enhance image quality with various editing tools\\n- Easy-to-use interface with intuitive controls\\n- Save and share your enhanced photos directly from the app\\n\\nDownload Restore: AI Photo Enhancer today and unlock the true potential of your old photos. Experience the joy of revitalizing your memories, preserving them for future generations, and reliving those special moments with newfound clarity and vibrancy.\\n\\nTerms and pricing:\\nOur yearly subscription costs $99 USD/year and provides you with unlimited access to premium features, as long as your subscription remains active. The subscription automatically renews, and payment will be charged to your iTunes account when you confirm the initial purchase. If you do not wish to renew your subscription, you may turn off the auto-renewal option in your Account Settings at least 24-hours before the current subscription period ends. For more information, please refer to our terms of service available at https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/ or privacy policy on https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tbM5LUHTSmyeZt4kDGzXTXqZwK6dAaMqZFHTwHIuwFU/edit?usp=sharing\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"minor bugs fixed and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-19\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-19T14:46:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Enhanced UI/UX, resolved minor bugs, and boosted performance\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-09T12:28:47Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This version incorporates enhanced performance improvements specifically focused on image restoration.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-29T15:48:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-23T15:09:35Z\"}],\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6448942710\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=phoenix\u0026appExtVrsId=872618749\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"R$Â 0,00\",\"price\":0,\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"currencyCode\":\"BRL\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":13399040}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6448942710\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=phoenix\u0026appExtVrsId=872618749\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"R$Â 0,00\",\"price\":0,\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"currencyCode\":\"BRL\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":13399040}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-23\",\"hasInAppPurchases\