r photos.\\n- Easy-to-Use Interface: Simply select a photo from your gallery, choose the faces you want to swap, and let our app do the rest!\\n- Realistic Results: Our AI ensures that face swaps look natural and blend seamlessly with the original photo.\\n- Save to Gallery: Easily save your creations directly to your device's gallery for future sharing or editing.\\n\\nWhether you want to create funny memes, surprise your friends with unique photos, or simply have fun with face swapping, AI Faceswap is the perfect app for you.Â \\n\\nDownload now and unleash your creativity!\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Content filtering added.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-14T07:17:50Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Performance optimizations\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-01T23:10:29Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Video support added.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-15T19:56:22Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Performance optimizations.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-10T13:46:27Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-04T20:01:01Z\"}],\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6480458740\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=phoenix\u0026appExtVrsId=872466970\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"R$Â 0,00\",\"price\":0,\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"currencyCode\":\"BRL\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":2052096}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026sal