ityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o visionOSÂ 1.0 ou posterior.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"14.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Crafted with a decade of dedication and refinement. Built in Taiwan, just like Synology.\\n\\nUSER REVIEWS\\nâWorks very well. The best I have tried!â\\nâGreat functionality and works reliably, always. Excellent range of options and super easy to set up. Brilliant.â\\nâBeen using for several years and this works great.â\\nÂ \\nINTRODUCTION\\nâ¢ Super easy to set up and use.\\nâ¢ Complete and robust backup tools and settings.\\nâ¢ Use Synology official API.\\nâ¢ Support QuickConnect and 2FA login.\\n\\nKEY FEATURES\\nâ¢ Export all internal photo data and format.\\nâ¢ Exclude unwanted photos from backup.\\nâ¢ Automatically backup your photos in background.\\nâ¢ Synchronize your photos, including albums and favorites.\\nâ¢ Backup history and statistics.\\nâ¢ Free up space on your devices after backup.\\nâ¢ Backup reminder and progress notification.\\n** Some features are available with a free trial.\\n\\nNOTES\\nâ¢ A Synology NAS is required.\\nâ¢ Third-party apps have a limited background time. Please do your first backup in foreground.\\nâ¢ This app is not affiliated with Synology.\\n\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"7.09\",\"releaseNotes\":\"â¢ âOptionsâ is renamed to âSettingsâ with new user interfaces.\\nâ¢ Improved user interface and stability.\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-14T02:31:57Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"7.08\",\"releaseNotes\":\"â¢ âNAS Settingsâ renamed to âNAS Connectâ with new user interface.\\nâ¢ Improved user interface and stability.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-04-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-04-01T02:31:16Z\"},{\"versionD