/br/apps/6477426690?l=pt-BR\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Dados usados para rastrear vocÃª\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_USED_TO_TRACK_YOU\",\"description\":\"Os seguintes dados podem ser usados para rastrear vocÃª em apps e sites de propriedade de outras empresas:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"IdentificadoÂ­res\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"InformaÃ§Ãµes de uso\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Dados nÃ£o vinculados a vocÃª\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"Os seguintes dados podem ser coletados, mas nÃ£o estÃ£o vinculados Ã  sua identidade:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"IdentificadoÂ­res\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"InformaÃ§Ãµes de uso\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"DiagnÃ³stico\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsBrazil\":{\"name\":\"Brazil L\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":6},\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"+4\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":1}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/br/app/face-swap-video-ai-face-swap/id6477426690\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":5,\"ratingCount\":1,\"ratingCountList\":[0,0,0,0,1],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"5.0 estrelas\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0\",\"name\":\"Face Swap Video - AI Face Swap\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Foto e vÃ­deo\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":true,\"artistName\":\"Nikhil Viradiya\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPodÂ touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iOSÂ 15.0 ou posterior.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iOSÂ 15.0 ou posterior.\"},\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iPadOSÂ 15.0 ou posterior.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o macOSÂ 12.0 ou posterior e um Mac com o chip M1 da Apple ou posterior.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o visionOSÂ 1.0 ou posterior.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"12.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"AI GIF Face Swap - the only app which lets users to face swap their photo on any GIFs.\\n\\nAn AI-powered video Face Swap app, which lets you create videos in no time. This app contains various face swap templates, enables to change face in AI videos, images with only one selfie needed. \\n\\nAI GIF Face - Meme Maker is face swap app powered by AI. With this app, you can change your re face with just one click. All kinds of fun face swaps are offered by the app, whether it is temperament beauty girl, sports star, various hairstyles, attractive men, which style you like, you can make AI video with one key. Choose a face photo of yourself and make yourself the main character.\\n\\nThe other main functionality of this app is that it lets you create Face Swap on GIFs too. This feature is completely unique from all the other apps. Instantly switch faces with a simple tap! Watch in awe as you and your friends become more funny of your own show!\\n\\nCreate face swap videos using your favorite TV shows, movies, and celebrities!\\n\\nFEATURES:\\n\\n- A quick way to find the face swap between two faces\\n- A wide range of video templates\\n- Easy crop and adjust into swap face\\n- Face swap allows to pick photos from the Photos app or through the camera\\n- Easy to generate and save into the creation folder\\n- Create funny face swap videos with ease \\n- Unleash your creativity to swap faces into another video template\\n\\nFor more information :-\\nPrivacy Policy - https://sites.google.com/view/nikhilviradiyaprivacypolicy/home\\nTerms of use - https://sites.google.com/view/nikhilviradiyatermsofuse/hom