"Mobile Software Applications\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/br/developer/nikhil-viradiya/id1639499778\"}}]},\"genres\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/br/apps/6477426690/genres?l=pt-BR\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6008\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/br/genres/6008?l=pt-BR\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Foto e vÃ­deo\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/br/genre/id6008\",\"parentId\":\"36\"}},{\"id\":\"6016\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/br/genres/6016?l=pt-BR\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"EntreteniÂ­mento\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/br/genre/id6016\",\"parentId\":\"36\"}}]}},\"meta\":{\"contentVersion\":{\"MZ_INDEXER\":1744871565700,\"RTCI\":1739093166037}}},{\"id\":\"6479184202\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/br/apps/6479184202?l=pt-BR\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Dados nÃ£o coletados\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_COLLECTED\",\"description\":\"Os desenvolvedores nÃ£o coletam nenhum dado deste app.\",\"dataCategories\":[]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsBrazil\":{\"name\":\"Brazil 18\",\"value\":600,\"rank\":11},\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"+17\",\"value\":600,\"rank\":4}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/br/app/faceswapper-instant-face-swap/id6479184202\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.6,\"ratingCount\":10,\"ratingCountList\":[1,0,0,0,9],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.6 estrelas\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.1\",\"name\":\"FaceSwapper -Instant Face Swap\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Foto e vÃ­deo\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":true,\"artistName\":\"Piyush Mangukiya\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPodÂ touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iOSÂ 13.4 ou posterior.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o iOSÂ 13.4 ou posterior.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o macOSÂ 11.0 ou posterior e um Mac com o chip M1 da Apple ou posterior.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requer o visionOSÂ 1.0 ou posterior.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Welcome to FaceSwapper, the ultimate app for instant and effortless face swapping! Our app brings fun and creativity right to your fingertips. Whether you're looking to create hilarious photos, try on new looks, or just have a good laugh with friends, FaceSwapper is your go-to solution.\\n\\n Key Features:\\n\\n- Instant Face Swap: Experience the magic of seamless face swapping with just a tap.\\n- User-Friendly Interface: Enjoy an intuitive and straightforward interface, perfect for users of all ages.\\n- Wide Range of Filters: Explore a variety of filters to enhance your face swaps.\\n- High-Quality Results: Get crisp, clear, and realistic face swap results every time.\\n- Share with Friends: Easily share your creations on social media or via messaging apps.\\n- Regular Updates: We're constantly adding new features and improving your experience.\\n\\n Why FaceSwapper?\\n\\n- Perfect for Parties: Be the life of the party with funny face swap photos.\\n- Creative Expression: Unleash your creativity by mixing and matching faces in unique ways.\\n- Memory Making: Create unforgettable, amusing photos with friends and family.\\n- Safe and Secure: We value your privacy and ensure the safety of your data.\\n\\n Getting Started:\\n\\n1. Download FaceSwapper and open the app.\\n2. Choose a photo from your gallery or take a new one.\\n3. Select the face you want to swap.\\n4. Watch as our app works its magic!\\n5. Save or share your face-swapped photo.\\n\\nFaceSwapper is not just an app; it's a doorway to endless fun and laughter. Whether you're aiming to prank your friends, see how you'd look with a different face, or just pass time with some photo fun, FaceSwapper has you covered.\\n\\nDownload now and join the face-swapping adventure today!\\\"\\n\\nRemember, it's crucial to update the description regularly with new features and to respond to user feedback to keep it relevant and engaging.\\n\\nTerms of use:- https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\\nPrivacy:- https://glittering-pavlova-ea8390.netlify.app/privacy\\n\\n\\n\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New Features\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-03T16:09:21Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-03-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-03-14T14:53:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2024-03-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-03-12T01:09:19Z\"}],\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6479184202\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=phoenix\u0026appExtVrsId=868561455\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"R$Â 0,00\",\"price\":0,\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"currencyCode\":\"BRL\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":89398272}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6479184202\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=phoenix\u0026appExtVrsId=868561455\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"R$Â 0,00\",\"price\":0,\"priceString\":\"0.00\",\"currencyCode\":\"BRL\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":89398272}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2024-03-11\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"com.faceswapperai.app\