 and data-safe faceswitchapp!\\n\\n3 Simple Steps to Create a Face Swap Video\\nFakeFaceapp comes with user-friendly and easy-to-use interface.Make face morph only within 3 STEPS:\\n-Upload the video/photo you want to swap face.\\n-Choose the face you want to switch.\\n- Download thegeneratedvideo/photo.\\n\\nWithFakeFace,it's simpleto...\\n\\n- Put your face on video of favorite movie scenes.Act like a movie star, and be as gorgeous as they are;See yourself in a superhero outfit and in the most famous scenes\\n- Experiment with live face changer and gender swaps. Makeahilarious compositionsandhumorous memetoshareon TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, Snapchat, or even Twitter\\n- Makeabeautifulportrait.Wanna record a trendiest short video? Thereâs no need to try so hard to shoot one.Findatrendyvideoandswapit.\\n- Create funny face short videos or images to share with your friends.\\n-Boost Your Likes.Just one click,boost your likes on social media, or to amaze your friends, just share it to your friends via Facebook, Instagram, WhatsApp, etc.\\n\\nFakeFaceÂ· Main Features\\n- Advanced Deepfaketechnology\\nYou will be provided with the most advanced AI face changing technology byFakeFaceapp it's easy to precisely map your face onto your chosen video, no matter if the figure in your video is singing, dancing, shouting, or crying.\\n- Customizability\\nUploadanyvideo/photosyou want to reface.FakeFaceAI will automatically analyzeandswap them fast.\\n- Reface Multiple Faces One Time\\nFakeFacefeatures extremely powerful AI algorithm and training models behind.\\nYou can reshape up to 6 faces in the same clip on this online face swap software, completely unachievable with other products in such a short processing time!\\n\\n- HD+\\nFakeFace is here to blow you away with amazing AI high-definition functionality besidesdeepfake.The video/photoafterface-swapingeven has a higher definition  than the one you uploaded.\\n\\n- Data-Safe\\nWe are committed to protecting your personal information and all your content uploaded and created on this online face morph maker.\\nÂ·No data collected\\nÂ·No content filters\\nAre you ready to find out the magic ofFakeFaceApp? Download it now! Create the drama and ruin reality!\\n\\nIn case of any questions, feature requests, issues, or collaboration requests, contact us: fakefaceapp@gmail.com\\n\\nTerms and Conditions: https://www.fakefaceapp.com/aboutus/\\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.fakefaceapp.com/privacypolicy/\\n\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We've introduced and upgraded some features to help you make even more amazing reface videos\\n1.Optimized some experiences.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-24T11:18:33Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We've introduced and upgraded some features to help you make even more amazing reface videos\\n1.Optimized some experiences.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-11T18:07:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We've introduced and upgraded some features to help you make even more amazing reface videos\\n1.Optimized some experiences.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-06T00:49:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We've introduced and upgraded some features to help you make even more amazing reface videos\\n1.This version has developed a new feature - notification capability: FakeFace will send you notifications after the task is completed to enjoy your creativity in a timely manner.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-04T21:29:50Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We've introduced and upgraded some features to help you make even more amazing reface videos\\n1.Add feedback function for smoother communication with F